    "updated_at": "2020-10-04T19:09:04Z",
    "body": "I would agree with that solution and that order:\r\nIf you have a venv active, you have a python in your path which points to the current venv, even if it is a py3 version. So searching for py, py3 and then py2 will probably do the right thing in most cases.",
